  "historyNote": "#7810, EMERGENCY, eff 12-26-02, EXPIRES: 6-24-03; ss #7853, eff 3-12-03; amd by #9185, eff 6-21-08; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11 New. #10041, eff 12-16-11",
